license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Osinoma/ngx-dol"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23823011"
abstract: "Open parser and derived liquidity measures for all equities listed on the Nigerian Exchange, 2014-06-30 to 2026-10-30: security-month Amihud illiquidity, zero-return share and turnover, daily market totals and weekly broker-concentration indices, built from the NGX Data Library with a published QA log. The code rebuilds the full security-day panel from NGX public reports."
keywords:
  - Nigeria
  - Nigerian Exchange
  - NGX
  - equity market
  - market microstructure
  - liquidity
  - Amihud illiquidity
  - frontier markets
  - open data
